<title>USA: Edac CEO leaves to pursue other interests.</title>
<headline>Edac CEO leaves to pursue other interests.</headline>
<dateline>FAMRINGTON, Conn. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edac Technologies Corp said on Friday that chief executive officer Robert Whitty was leaving the company to pursue other interests and would be replaced by Edward McNerney.</p>
<p>The company said McNerney had management experience at small and large metal working firms and most recently worked for Ingersoll-Rand Co subsidiary Torrington Co as manager of North American manufacturing.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
